<title>UK: Airtours up as Hoare Govett rates &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Airtours up as Hoare Govett rates &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Airtours Plc rose on Wednesday as analysts at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett issued a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Airtours shares, which have retreated from their record 10.51 stg set March 12, were up 15-1/2p at 970-1/2 by 1049 GMT in volume of 109,601 shares.</p>
<p>Analysts at Hoare Govett were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
